  "goodToKnow": "Tangieren means to affect or concern, a formal word: Die Reform tangiert die Rechte der Länder. In mathematics, it means to touch a curve, and die Tangente is a tangent (also a bypass road). The ironic phrase Das tangiert mich nur peripher means I couldn't care less. Synonyms: betreffen, berühren. From Latin tangere (to touch). Perfect: hat tangiert."
